      "t": "'There are migrants in my courtyard.' Dmitry links 'my' directly with 'yard' to express the thought clearly.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Из ресторана Аркабалена.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
