    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Они режут живого барана.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They are slaughtering a live ram.' Dmitry combines 'they' with 'ram' in a natural Russian turn of phrase.",
